sequenceDiagram
    actor Agent as Agent de contrôle
    participant UI as Festival Control
    participant API as Access API
    participant Access as AccessService
    participant Ticket as Ticket Data
    participant Zone as Zone Data

    Agent->>UI: scanne un bracelet
    UI->>API: POST /api/access/check
    API->>Access: checkAccess(wristbandId, zoneId)
    Access->>Ticket: vérifier bracelet + ticket actif + validité
    Ticket-->>Access: identité et droits
    Access->>Zone: vérifier niveau requis + capacité
    Zone-->>Access: règles et occupation
    alt Accès autorisé
      Access-->>API: ACCESS_GRANTED
      API-->>UI: 200
    else Accès refusé
      Access-->>API: motif métier
      API-->>UI: 403
    end
